WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:02.464
Hello! [s@Hello!

2
00:00:03.185 --> 00:00:04.105
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.265 --> 00:00:06.245
I'm a wild turkey.

4
00:00:06.566 --> 00:00:11.427
Turkeys are large birds.

5
00:00:11.487 --> 00:00:13.608
Where do you live?

6
00:00:31.184 --> 00:00:32.985
We live all over the world.

7
00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.408
We like forests.

8
00:00:37.929 --> 00:00:41.151
But we also live in swamps and grasslands.

9
00:00:43.633 --> 00:00:44.634
What do you eat?

10
00:00:46.435 --> 00:00:49.917
Wild turkeys like nuts, seeds, and fruits.

11
00:00:51.799 --> 00:00:54.841
We also eat bugs and tiny animals.

12
00:00:56.402 --> 00:00:58.643
We scratch the ground to find food.

13
00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.481
You're a male turkey, right?

14
00:01:04.921 --> 00:01:07.862
Right! Males are bigger than females.

15
00:01:09.463 --> 00:01:11.503
Our heads are very colorful.

16
00:01:13.384 --> 00:01:15.524
And our tails look like fans.

17
00:01:18.165 --> 00:01:19.626
Can you make sounds?

18
00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:25.508
Yes! Male turkeys make a loud gobble sound.

19
00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:33.862
We are very loud sometimes!

20
00:01:36.283 --> 00:01:37.704
Do you ever fly?

21
00:01:39.886 --> 00:01:42.487
Wild turkeys like to walk and run.

22
00:01:44.889 --> 00:01:46.530
But we can fly too.

23
00:01:48.992 --> 00:01:51.574
At night we fly up into trees.

24
00:01:55.876 --> 00:01:57.197
I see your flock!

25
00:01:59.279 --> 00:02:00.800
We like to stay in groups.

26
00:02:02.804 --> 00:02:04.986
That keeps us safe from enemies.

27
00:02:06.808 --> 00:02:10.152
Coyotes, foxes, and people hunt us.

28
00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:15.637
I need some sleep.

29
00:02:17.098 --> 00:02:17.979
Gobble! Gobble!

30
00:02:20.442 --> 00:02:22.083
Good night, Wild Turkey!
